msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Yeah, have you seen them yet?  They're these shitty walking flowers with a "
"big <freaking> stinger in the middle.  They travel in packs.  They hate the "
"zombies, and we were using them for cover to clear a horde of the dead.  "
"Unfortunately, turns out the plants are better trackers than the <zombies>.  "
"They almost seemed intelligent… I barely made it out, only because they were,"
" uh, distracted."
