msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"What, like some secret Batcave?  Pull back the curtain and it turns out I'm "
"the communist <name_b> who brewed up a demon bio-weapon in their basement?  I"
" just gave you food, all the tools in my workshop, and the safest hole in the"
" ground in the county.  If I've got any secrets left, they're mine to keep."
msgstr ""

