#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/professor_1.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'm actually a chemistry professor at Harvard.  I'd been on sabbatical for "
"the last six months.  I can't imagine the university was a good place to be, "
"given what I've heard about Boston… I'm not sure anyone made it out.  I was "
"out at my cabin near Chatham, ostensibly working on the finishing touches for"
" a paper, but mostly just sipping whisky and thanking my lucky stars for "
"tenure.  Those were good days.  Then came <the_cataclysm>, the military "
"convoys, the <zombies>.  My cabin was crushed by a fearsome beast, just "
"collateral damage after it got blasted off Orleans by a tank.  I was already "
"busy running frantically by then."
msgstr ""

