#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Check out that farm"
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/rural_1.json
msgid "Any luck finding the farm?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Check out that farm"
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/rural_1.json
msgid ""
"I don't know how I can ever make it up to you!  I barely made it out of this "
"place alive.  I wasn't sure I'd ever see it again, to be honest."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Check out that farm"
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/rural_1.json
msgid "I guess I don't blame you.  I knew it wouldn't be easy."
