msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"We got to my buddy's ranch, but the <freaking> g-men had been there first.  "
"It was all boarded up and there was a police barricade out front.  One of "
"those <freaking> turrets… shot Buck.  Almost got me too.  I managed to get my"
" pup… get him outta there, that… it wasn't easy, had to use a police car door"
" as a shield, had to kill a cop-zombie first.  And then, well, while I was "
"still cryin', Buck came back.  I had to…  <swear!>  I… I can't say it.  You "
"know."
msgstr ""

